# Sandsunk Necropolis's embalmers' galleries (CIPlay sandsunk_necropolis_caves, 11-12 w07; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe: in at the open tomb front at -23 0, along the gallery to the hall (-34..-41, 0), the niche
# room off it (-41 1.5 to -45 6.5), back out through the second gallery to the front at -23 6. Floors ~3 m.
island Sandsunk Necropolis keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
# (11-13 cavemix, TODO 0f) the cave's hyena: alive, on the dug floor under the hill's rock, then dealt with - checked
# from the processional way 47 m off (from the tomb front at -18 0 it ran out at the test player before the roof check)
at 0 -14
wait 2
expect animals Hyena 1
expect animalsinside Hyena 1
wait 2
picture sn_hyena -40 6.8 0.5 -43.5 5.5 4.5 aim=Hyena light=20
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0
at -18 0
wait 2
picture sn_fronts -12 5 3 -24 4.5 3
walk -20 0 to -23 0 to -34 0 to -40 0 below=8
picture sn_hall -26 6.8 0 -40 5.6 0 light=20
walk -40 0 to -41 1.5 to -44.5 6 below=8
picture sn_niche -40 6.8 0.5 -45 5.6 6.5 light=20
walk -44.5 6 to -41 1.5 to -38 3 to -33 6.5 to -23 6 to -20 6 below=8
picture sn_gallery_out -33 6.8 6.5 -22 5.4 6 light=20
